@startuml
title Dynamic revision round
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "academic-paper:revision" as Revise
participant "reviewer:re-review" as ReReview
database "Controls + handoffs" as Files
Agent -> User : round-specific route summary
User --> Agent : confirm round
Agent -> CLI : start round with parent + round number
CLI -> Files : round control + handoff
Agent -> User : confirm revision child
Agent -> Revise : produce revised manuscript / response
Revise -> Files : external outputs + child handoff
Agent -> User : confirm re-review child
Agent -> ReReview : verify prior concerns
ReReview -> Files : verification report + child handoff
Agent -> User : accepted or another revision?
User --> Agent : branch Decision
Agent -> CLI : decide + advance round
@enduml
